 "summary": "Go to the abandoned Marbelle Hotel in Crosstown, Vice City, near the Nine1Nine club. The front door is locked, so use the back door. On the top floor the lights die, red symbols cover the walls and you hear whispers; then the roof door opens on a city lost in fog. An old note up there has a safe code (955214).",
